# Keep the build context lean and deterministic. Dependencies are installed
# inside the image from the lockfile; never copy host node_modules in.
**/node_modules
# The pnpm content-addressable store is a host build cache (hundreds of MB of
# extracted packages incl. native binaries). Never copy it into the image — it
# bloats the context and trivy flags its vendored binaries' CVEs (e.g. esbuild's
# Go stdlib) even though nothing at runtime uses the store.
**/.pnpm-store
pnpm-store
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/.DS_Store
**/.vite
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
